          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ kui̱ dolä ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl, käni kɛl kä jiɛɛn dhieec, kä naath kɛnɛ ɣɔ̱k kɛ muɔ̱li kɛnɛ det ala tho̱lbo̱k, kä bikɛ ka̱m ji̱ Lii-bay tin guɛckɛ kɛmɛkä Kuɔth Nhial.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Muthɛ kɛnɛ Ɛl-a-dhar bo̱o̱th palä jɛ la̱t ce̱tnikɛ min ci Kuoth Nhial ɛ la̱r Muthɛ.",
          "type": "text",
