          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Muthɛ tho̱lbo̱k in ca thöp Kuoth Nhial ka̱m Ɛl-a-dhar bo̱o̱th palä, ce̱tnikɛ mëë ci Kuoth Nhial ɛ la̱r jɛ.",
