              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu bööth tëë te wi̱i̱ bathdɔɔri rɛ̈m, bööth bathdɔɔri kɛnɛ bööth kuri ben kä Muthɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ jɛ jiök i̱, “Ca̱kɔ nɛy tin bo̱o̱th nɛɛkɛ kuɛn kä thilɛ ram mi ci dueer kä kɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ca̱kɔ Kuoth Nhial nöŋ muc, da̱a̱p kɛ ciik tin bo̱o̱r kɛ kuat ŋua̱a̱k. Kɛ ciik yɛtni, kɛnɛ ciik ji̱thni, kɛ tiɛk ti luɛl nɛy kɛ rɔ nhiam Kuɔth Nhial.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Muthɛ kɛnɛ Ɛl-a-dhar bo̱o̱th palä da̱a̱p ka̱n kä kɛ, kɛ tin diaal tin ca la̱t. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Muthɛ kɛnɛ Ɛl-a-dhar da̱a̱p thöp Kuoth Nhial ala muc mi theemdɛ bathdɔɔri wäl bäkɛl wi̱cdɛ kur bärɔw wi̱cdɛ yio̱w ti jiɛɛn dhieec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Kä cu ji̱ ko̱o̱r rɔ moc pɛ̈ɛ̈c ti ŋuan.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Muthɛ kɛnɛ Ɛl-a-dhar da̱a̱p ka̱n tetni bööthni bathdɔɔri kɛnɛ kur kä cua naŋ rɛy kɛmɛkä Kuoth Nhial, ala mi tiɛmkɛ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl nhiam Kuɔth Nhial.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.54"
            ]
          }
        }
